{"Title":"An Act authorizing the continued employment of Anthony Tranghese as an environmental police officer in the Executive Office of Energy and Environmental Affairs","BillNumber":"H4513","DocketNumber":"HD4963","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2024-03-01T09:40:58.897"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2024-03-01T09:40:58.91"},{"Id":"JRO0","Name":"Jacob R. Oliveira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JRO0","ResponseDate":"2024-03-26T11:34:01.1566667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4513/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Puppolo of Springfield, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr., for legislation to authorize the continued employment of Anthony Tranghese as an environmental police officer in the Executive Office of Energy and Environmental Affairs.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, Anthony Tranghese, an environmental police officer in the executive office of energy and environmental affairs, may continue to serve in that position until he reaches 70 years of age or the date of his retirement or non-reappointment, whichever occurs first. No further deductions shall be made from the regular compensation of Anthony Tranghese under chapter 32 of the General Laws for any service performed subsequent to his reaching the age of 65 and, upon retirement, Anthony Tranghese shall receive a superannuation retirement allowance equal to the allowance to which he would have been entitled had he retired upon reaching the age of 65.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}